data: {"id": "92297ff8a5f3415d-thinking-parallel_evidence-1606", "run_id": "92297ff8a5f3415d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **当前 Pod 状态**：\n   - 物理状态为 `Running`，但容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting` 状态，`Reason: CrashLoopBackOff`。\n   - `Ready: False`，因为容器未就绪。\n\n2. **退出码与 Last State**：\n   - `Last State: Terminated`，`Reason: Error`，`Exit Code: 78`。\n   - 容器重启次数：15 次。\n\n3. **Command/配置**：\n   - Pod YAML 显示 container `app` 的 `Environment: <none>`，即没有任何环境变量。\n   - Command 为：`python3 -u -c import os, sys; value = os.getenv('APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG'); ... sys.exit(78 if value is None else 0)`，该进程检查环境变量 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG`，如果缺失则打印错误消息并", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789143183277, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

